{"seq":3,"slug":"electronic-technology-basics","title":"电子技术基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/mechanical-electrical-basics/electronic-technology-basics","wordCount":1501,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"电子技术基础\">电子技术基础</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>电子技术在机电设备中承担信号采集、处理和控制的关键角色。从生产线上的光电传感器到 PLC 输入模块的信号调理电路，从变频器的整流逆变单元到机器人控制器的数据处理，电子技术无处不在。掌握半导体器件特性、基本电路原理和数字逻辑知识，才能理解现代自动化设备的内部工作机制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"半导体器件\">半导体器件</h3><p><strong>二极管</strong>是最基本的半导体器件，具有单向导电性。正向导通时压降约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.7</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.7V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>（硅管），反向截止时仅有微安级漏电流。</p>\n<p>常用二极管类型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>整流二极管：将交流变为直流（如桥式整流）</li>\n<li>稳压二极管：利用反向击穿特性稳定电压</li>\n<li>发光二极管（LED）：指示灯和照明</li>\n<li>光电二极管：光信号检测</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>三极管</strong>（BJT）是电流控制型器件，具有放大作用。三个工作区域：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>放大区</td>\n<td>发射结正偏，集电结反偏</td>\n<td>信号放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饱和区</td>\n<td>两个结均正偏</td>\n<td>开关导通（相当于闭合）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截止区</td>\n<td>两个结均反偏</td>\n<td>开关断开</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在机电控制中，三极管常用作开关——PLC 的晶体管输出模块内部就是以三极管的饱和/截止状态来控制外部负载的通断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基本放大电路\">基本放大电路</h3><p>共射极放大电路是最基础的模拟信号放大单元。静态工作点的设置决定了电路能否正常工作：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_C = \\beta \\cdot I_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{CE} = V_{CC} - I_C \\cdot R_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>电压增益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示输出信号相对输入信号的放大倍数。实际工业应用中，运算放大器（集成运放）已经取代分立元件放大电路，常用于传感器信号的放大和滤波。</p>\n<p>运放的两个重要特性：虚短（同相端和反相端电压近似相等）和虚断（输入端电流近似为零）。反相放大电路的增益：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_v = -\\frac{R_f}{R_1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"数字逻辑电路基础\">数字逻辑电路基础</h3><p>数字电路只处理两种状态：高电平（1）和低电平（0），对应机电控制中的&quot;开&quot;与&quot;关&quot;。</p>\n<p>基本逻辑门：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>逻辑门</th>\n<th>表达式</th>\n<th>功能描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>与门 AND</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = A \\cdot B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>所有输入为 1 时输出 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>或门 OR</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = A + B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>任一输入为 1 时输出 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非门 NOT</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = \\overline{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>输入取反</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与非门 NAND</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = \\overline{A \\cdot B}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>与门输出取反</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>组合逻辑应用举例：某设备需要同时满足&quot;安全门关闭&quot;（A=1）和&quot;急停未按下&quot;（B=1）两个条件才能启动，这就是一个与逻辑：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = A \\cdot B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>时序逻辑中的触发器可以记忆状态，是计数器和寄存器的基础单元。PLC 内部的定时器和计数器本质上就是由触发器构成的数字电路。</p>\n<h3 id=\"传感器与信号转换\">传感器与信号转换</h3><p>传感器是自动化系统的&quot;感觉器官&quot;，将物理量转换为电信号：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;物理量&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;传感器&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;电信号&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;信号调理&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;PLC/控制器&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"物理量\"] --&gt; B[\"传感器\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"电信号\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"信号调理\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"PLC/控制器\"]</pre><p>常见工业传感器：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传感器类型</th>\n<th>检测对象</th>\n<th>输出信号</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光电传感器</td>\n<td>物体有无</td>\n<td>开关量 NPN/PNP</td>\n<td>产线计数、位置检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接近开关</td>\n<td>金属物体距离</td>\n<td>开关量</td>\n<td>行程限位、零件到位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热电偶</td>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>mV 级模拟量</td>\n<td>炉温监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压力变送器</td>\n<td>压力</td>\n<td>4-20mA</td>\n<td>液压系统压力监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编码器</td>\n<td>转角/转速</td>\n<td>脉冲</td>\n<td>伺服电机反馈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>传感器输出信号通常需要经过放大、滤波、A/D 转换等调理过程才能被控制器读取。4-20mA 电流环是工业中最常用的模拟信号传输标准，其优势在于抗干扰能力强、传输距离远。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026 年工业传感器向智能化和微型化方向快速发展。MEMS 传感器（微机电系统）将传感元件、信号处理电路和通信接口集成在单颗芯片上，成本持续下降。IO-Link 数字通信协议正在替代传统的模拟信号传输，实现传感器的即插即用和远程参数配置。此外，宽禁带半导体材料（碳化硅 SiC、氮化镓 GaN）在电力电子领域加速应用，变频器和伺服驱动器的效率和功率密度持续提升，这些技术进步直接影响机电设备的性能表现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>解释为什么 PLC 晶体管输出模块只能驱动直流负载，而继电器输出模块可以驱动交流和直流负载。</li>\n<li>某温度传感器输出 0-10mV 对应 0-100°C，需要放大到 0-5V 送入 PLC 模拟量输入模块，设计运放放大电路并计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的值。</li>\n<li>用与门、或门和非门组合设计一个逻辑电路：当&quot;工件到位&quot;且（&quot;自动模式&quot;或&quot;手动启动按钮按下&quot;）时，机械手动作。画出逻辑电路图并写出逻辑表达式。</li>\n<li>一条产线安装了 NPN 型光电传感器用于计数，但发现 PLC 无法正确接收信号。分析可能的接线错误（提示：NPN 与 PNP 的接线方式有何区别？）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>电子技术基础为理解自动化控制设备的内部工作原理提供了必要知识。半导体器件的开关特性是数字控制的物理基础；放大电路和运放解决传感器微弱信号的检测问题；数字逻辑电路的分析方法与 PLC 梯形图编程思想一脉相承；传感器作为自动化系统的信息入口，其选型和接线是现场工程师的日常工作。这些知识将在后续 PLC 编程和设备维修章节中得到持续运用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电子技术基础","id":"电子技术基础"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"半导体器件","id":"半导体器件"},{"level":3,"text":"基本放大电路","id":"基本放大电路"},{"level":3,"text":"数字逻辑电路基础","id":"数字逻辑电路基础"},{"level":3,"text":"传感器与信号转换","id":"传感器与信号转换"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电工电路与元器件","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/mechanical-electrical-basics/electrical-circuits-components"},"next":{"title":"PLC编程基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/plc-automation/plc-programming-basics"}}